{
  "name": "ListInstanceDetails",
  "summary": "查询数据库实例列表/查询实例详情",
  "tags": "实例管理",
  "productshort": "GaussDBforopenGauss",
  "region_id": "af-north-1",
  "paths": {
    "/v3.2/{project_id}/instances": {
      "get": {
        "x-request-examples-url-1": "GET https://{endpoint}/v3.2/97b026aa9cc4417888c14c84a1ad9860/instances?id=ed7cc6166ec24360a5ed5c5c9c2ed726in14&name=hy&type=Enterprise&datastore_type=GaussDB&vpc_id=19e5d45d-70fd-4a91-87e9-b27e71c9891f&subnet_id=bd51fb45-2dcb-4296-8783-8623bfe89bb7&offset=0&limit=10",
        "x-request-examples-description-1": "根据指定条件查询实例列表",
        "x-request-examples-url-2": "GET https://{endpoint}/v3.2/97b026aa9cc4417888c14c84a1ad9860/instances",
        "x-request-examples-description-2": "查询所有实例列表",
        "tags": [
          "实例管理"
        ],
        "operationId": "ListInstanceDetails",
        "summary": "查询数据库实例列表/查询实例详情",
        "description": "查询数据库实例列表/查询实例详情",
        "x-api-type": "open-api",
        "x-apiexplorer-hide": "false",
        "x-apigateway-ratelimit": "opengauss_default_policy",
        "x-support-sdk": "Y",
        "x-is-registered": "Y",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "X-Auth-Token",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n用户Token。\n通过调用IAM服务[获取用户token](https://support.huaweicloud.com/intl/zh-cn/api-iam/iam_30_0001.html)。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及。\n**取值范围**:\n不涉及。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "x-example": "******"
          },
          {
            "name": "X-Language",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "语言",
            "type": "string",
            "x-example": "zh-cn"
          },
          {
            "name": "project_id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n租户在某一Region下的项目ID。\n获取方法请参见[获取项目ID](https://support.huaweicloud.com/api-gaussdb/gaussdb_api_196.html)。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及。\n**取值范围**:\n只能由英文字母、数字组成,且长度为32个字符。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "x-example": "619d3e78f61b4be68bc5aa0b59edcf7b"
          },
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "实例ID。\n\n“\\*”为系统保留字符,如果id是以“\\*”起始,表示按照\\*后面的值模糊匹配,否则,按照id精确匹配查询。不能只传入“\\*”。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "name",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "实例名称。\n\n“\\*”为系统保留字符,如果name是以“\\*”起始,表示按照\\*后面的值模糊匹配,否则,按照name精确匹配查询。不能只传入“\\*”。",
            "type": "string",
            "required": false
          },
          {
            "name": "type",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "按照实例类型查询。目前仅支持取值“Enterprise”(区分大小写),对应分布式实例(企业版)。当前支持取值\"Ha\"(区分大小写),对应主备式实例。",
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "Enterprise",
              "Ha"
            ],
            "required": false
          },
          {
            "name": "datastore_type",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "数据库类型,区分大小写。\n\n- GaussDB",
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "GaussDB"
            ],
            "required": false
          },
          {
            "name": "vpc_id",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "虚拟私有云ID。\n\n方法1:登录虚拟私有云服务的控制台界面,在虚拟私有云的详情页面查找VPC ID。\n方法2:通过虚拟私有云服务的API接口查询,具体操作可参考[查询VPC列表](https://support.huaweicloud.com/api-vpc/vpc_api01_0003.html)。",
            "type": "string",
            "required": false
          },
          {
            "name": "subnet_id",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "子网的网络ID信息。\n\n- 方法1:登录虚拟私有云服务的控制台界面,单击VPC下的子网,进入子网详情页面,查找网络ID。\n- 方法2:通过虚拟私有云服务的API接口查询,具体操作可参考[查询子网列表](https://support.huaweicloud.com/api-vpc/vpc_subnet01_0003.html)。",
            "type": "string",
            "required": false
          },
          {
            "name": "offset",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "索引位置,偏移量。从第一条数据偏移offset条数据后开始查询,默认为0(偏移0条数据,表示从第一条数据开始查询),必须为数字,不能为负数。",
            "type": "integer",
            "required": false
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "查询记录数。默认为100,不能为负数,最小值为1,最大值为100",
            "type": "integer",
            "required": false
          },
          {
            "name": "tags",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "根据实例标签键值对进行查询。\n\n{key}表示标签键,不可以为空或重复。最大长度127个unicode字符。key不能为空或者空字符串,不能为空格,使用之前先trim前后半角空格。不能包含+/?#&=,%特殊字符。\n\n{value}表示标签值,可以为空。最大长度255个unicode字符,使用之前先trim 前后半角空格。不能包含+/?#&=,%特殊字符。\n\n如果value为空,则表示any_value(查询任意value)。\n\n如果同时使用多个标签键值对进行查询,中间使用逗号分隔开,最多包含10组。",
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "required": false
          },
          {
            "name": "charge_mode",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "计费模式。\n\n取值范围:\n\npostPaid:后付费,即按需付费。\n\nprePaid:预付费,即包年/包月。",
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "postPaid",
              "prePaid"
            ],
            "required": false
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "成功。",
